2026-10-25T01:41:38Z | manual | F4 (step 1.3) first run -> FAIL, and correctly so: the audit's own HF->GGUF map was missing `post_attention_norm` (it had `ffn_norm`), used `ssm_a.weight`/`ssm_dt.weight` where the template says `ssm_a`/`ssm_dt.bias`, sized `q_proj` without `attn_output_gate`, and did not model the documented `conv1d` squeeze or `ggml_n_dims`'s trailing-1 drop. Fixed from `gguf-py/gguf/constants.py` and `conversion/qwen.py`, not from the file's own shapes.
2026-10-25T01:42:18Z | manual | F4 (step 1.3): `--structure` -> PASS. 733/733 reconciled, 0 unreconciled, 0 expected-but-absent, 0 dim mismatches, 40 rank-convention rows.
